fields.description:
To retrieve fields for matter creation ref: mattercategories/{categoryId}/createSchema
Fields without grouping example serialization: "fields":{ "field_[fieldId]":null, "field_[fieldId]":false }
Fields with grouping example serialization: "fields":{ "group_[groupId]": { "field_[fieldId]":null, "field_[fieldId]":false } }
